//
// *** Must have Active Tool ***
//
FORM BLOCK
EDIT BLOCK RESET
BLOCK ACCEPT
//
FORM TOOLZHEIGHTS
EDIT TOOLPATH SAFEAREA RESET
TOOLZHEIGHTS ACCEPT
//
FORM DATUM
EDIT TOOLPATH START TYPE BLOCK
DATUM ACCEPT
//
CREATE WORKPLANE "TOPCENTRE" YES FORM WPEDIT
EDIT WORKPLANE "TOPCENTRE" ALIGN TOOL
TRANSFORM MOVE "-10"
TRANSFORM TYPE MOVE TRANSFORM MOVEZ PRESET TRANSFORM WORKPLANE "TOPCENTRE"
WPEDIT ACCEPT
//
//